 "resultsSection": {
  "participantFlowModule": {
   "preAssignmentDetails": "Complete crossover study to assess the efficacy and safety of GFF MDI vs. Placebo MDI. Each subject received 28 days of study treatment in each assigned treatment, with a minimum 7 day washout period between each of the 2 periods. By-treatment sequence tabulations of the data were not pre-specified.",
   "recruitmentDetails": "This study was conducted at 5 sites in the US from March 2015 to Jun 2015. The study was anticipated to run for approximately 6 months but not to expected to exceed 9 months.The study period was 11 to 17 weeks for each subject.",
